      "observed": "The netlist contains U5, a 74LVC1G86 single XOR gate, not listed in the specification. U5 pin 1 is tied to MCU PC1, pin 2 is tied to the SSD1306 VCC/C7 net, pin 4 is tied to SSD1306 pin 7 (N.C.), pin 5 is tied to VCC, and pin 3 is tied to GND.",
      "expected": "The specification describes Portal as an STM32L476 MCU with NFC, OLED, TSC, antenna, and one SWD connector, and its component table contains no extra logic gate. A powered XOR gate connected to an unused MCU GPIO, the OLED VCC supply net, and an OLED no-connect pin is not part of the intended design and is not consistent with standard practice.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(comp (ref \"U5\") (value \"74LVC1G86\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(node (ref \"U4\") (pin \"28\") (pinfunction \"VCC\") (pintype \"power_in\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "Portal is a single-PCB embedded controller built around an STM32L476RGT6 (ARM Cortex-M4) MCU with three user-facing peripherals:"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The board includes undocumented circuitry that loads PC1 and the OLED VCC net and drives an NC pin; this can alter OLED power/bias behavior and is consistent with an assembly, sourcing, or tampering deviation.",
      "confidence": 0.84
    },
    {
      "category": "open_connection",
      "components": [
        "U4",
        "C7",
        "U5"
      ],
      "pins": [
        "U4.28",
        "C7.1",
        "U5.2"
      ],
      "nets": [
        "Net-(U5-Pad2)",
        "GND",
        "VCC"
      ],
      "observed": "U4 pin 28 is named VCC and is a power_in, but it is not connected to the global VCC net. It is connected only to C7 pin 1 (to GND) and U5 pin 2 (a logic input).",
      "expected": "A SSD1306 VCC supply pin should be connected to a powered supply rail, as U4 VDD/VBAT/BS1 are connected to VCC, or otherwise be a documented separate output rail. A power_in pin should not be left floating except through a decoupling capacitor and an unrelated logic input.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(node (ref \"U4\") (pin \"28\") (pinfunction \"VCC\") (pintype \"power_in\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "spice",
          "quote": "C7 Net-_U5-Pad2_ 0 2.2u"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "C7 (2.2 µF) — U4 VCC (digital-logic supply pin) to GND"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The OLED driver's VCC supply node is unpowered/floating, so the display may fail to initialize or operate erratically.",
      "confidence": 0.68
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The build deviates from the specified Portal design by adding an unlisted 74LVC1G86 XOR gate U5 tied to MCU PC1 and the SSD1306 VCC/NC pins; additionally, the SSD1306 VCC power pin is not connected to the VCC rail and is left floating through C7 and U5."
}

